    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="33414021-dc8a-57e0-8306-664dd1e7f0eb" activityNameId="bb40e2e0-f8ad-5e45-ae4a-e84c1d458c78" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Geopolymer concrete pipe, precast concrete, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Geopolymer concrete pipe, precast concrete, at plant
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: ac67fdbf-585c-4c64-aba0-da41e7d34d71
This dataset represents the production of 1 m³ of precast geopolymer concrete pipe in Germany.
The dataset includes all waste treatment processes arising from the production phase at the precast plant.
The end-of-life treatment of the pipe itself (e.g., demolition, recycling, disposal) is not included and must be accounted for in downstream processes that use this dataset as an input.
Location: Europe
Technology: Production of precast geopolymer concrete pipe, using industrial machinery. Based on information provided by Röser GmbH, Steißlingen, Germany
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ac67fdbf-585c-4c64-aba0-da41e7d34d71.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
